{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/11/6589123/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/11/6589123/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/11/6589123/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(メイドまあや♪www)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/11/6589123/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/11/6589123/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★好きな歌って何ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/11/6589123/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・乃木坂はもちろん大好き!!\nその他AKBさんやNMBさんやSKEさん...アイドルも聞くのっ！\nでも沢山有りすぎて書ききれない...笑\nカラオケでも歌ったよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★最近の飲み物ベスト3教えて"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/11/6589123/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・1位...炭酸ジュース\n2位...タピオカジュース\n3位...アセロラ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★独り暮らしだとさみしくないの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/11/6589123/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・寂しいし、怖いときもあるよ〜っ！でも楽しいよ〜(^-^ゞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★同じ誕生の人に出会った事ある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/11/6589123/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・ないから、会ってみたいな〜♪\n日にちが近い日とならあったことあるー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★妹になってほしい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/11/6589123/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・嬉しい〜！！ありがとーm(._.)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★個握初めて行きます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/11/6589123/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・ありがとう♪逢えるのを楽しみにしてる！話す事なくても逢えるだけでも嬉しいです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★お化粧はしてるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/11/6589123/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・普段、はしないけど、お仕事のときとかするよ〜♪\nでもあまり濃くならないようにシンプルにしてる(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★一番得意料理はなんですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/11/6589123/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・お母さんによく喜んで食べてもらったのはオムライスだよ〜！昔、ハートのオムライスblogに載せたからよかったら見てー！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★俺も まあや族に入れて下さい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/11/6589123/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・本当に!?嬉し〜いです♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★りんご飴ってどういうもの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/11/6589123/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・普通のりんごの回りに赤い飴が着いてるとっても美味しいよ〜♪\n食べてみて〜大きいのと小さいのがあるよ〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★誰推しだと思う？まあや・真夏・まいやん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/11/6589123/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・う〜ん？？わかんないよ〜(T-T)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★あたしなんか何の助けにもなれなくて、まあやパワーの0．1%かもしれんくて..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/11/6589123/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・そんな事絶対にない！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやのことを最初からずっと応援してくれてて、パワーもらってるよ♪\nお互い夢に向かって頑張ろう！\nいつもありがとう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★お気に入りのコスメとかある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/11/6589123/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・これ私も教えてほしいんだ〜！気になるよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★１人暮らしでも元気がでるようなメッセージちょうだい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/11/6589123/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・１人じゃないよ！一緒に頑張ろう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★どこのもみじ饅頭がすき？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/11/6589123/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・にしきどうのしか食べた事ないんだ〜他のを知らないの〜！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★なんて呼ばれたい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/11/6589123/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・まあや\nとか...呼んでくれるのが嬉しいから、おまかせします笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★広島でオススメの食べ物は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/11/6589123/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・お好み焼き\n牡蠣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★1周年ライブの時メッセージボールを凄い勢いでぶつけた記憶ある？\nそして謝ってくれた？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/11/6589123/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・もちろん覚えてる〜\n大丈夫だったかな〜汗\nごめんなさい〜汗\nコントロール難しい！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★手軽に作れる料理教えて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/11/6589123/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・サラダ...笑...\n料理にならないかな...汗\nカレーとかシチューとか？楽だよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★新しい高校生活が怖くてたまりませんどうしたからいいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/11/6589123/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・このコメントを読んだ時、まあやも東京に出てきて誰も知らない学校に１人で行きだした時の事を思いだしました...\n１人暮らしと、初めての学校で、最初はワクワクしてたのに、行くのが怖くなった事もありました..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今はきっと不安でいっぱいだと思うけど\n誰かに少しでも話せたら少しはよくなると思うから...\n話してくれてありがとう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/11/6589123/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/11/6589123/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/11/6589123/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山のコメントや質問ありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/11/6589123/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初コメさんも沢山居てくれて嬉しい〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/11/6589123/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他推しの方もコメントくれてて♪ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/11/6589123/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女の子のコメントも増えてて嬉しいな〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/11/6589123/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもコメントくださる方も、いつも楽しみに読んでます♪ありがと〜う"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/11/6589123/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかもコメント200を越えて凄く嬉しいです(^o^)happy"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/11/6589123/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/11/6589123/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/11/6589123/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"顔がわかる方は思いだしながら読むのも楽しいんです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では学校が終わったのでこれからレッスン行ってきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/11/6589123/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆も体に気を付けて風邪ひきませんように♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もみんなが大好きです(*ノ▽ノ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/11/6589123/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/11/6589123/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}